text(local) RustboroCity_Text_WeShortenItToDevon {
	"The Devon Corporation\.\n"
	"We all just shorten it to Devon.\p"
	"That company makes all sorts of\n"
	"convenient products."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_SneakyLookingManWentAroundCorner {
	"Hm? A sneaky-looking man?\p"
	"Come to think of it, yes, a shady-\n"
	"looking guy went around the corner."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_HaveYouChallengedGym {
	"Have you taken the Pok\emon Gym\n"
	"challenge?\p"
	"When you get that shiny Gym Badge\n"
	"in hand, I guess Trainers begin to\l"
	"realize what is required of them."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_HeyThatsRustborosGymBadge {
	"Hey, that's Rustboro's Gym Badge!\p"
	"Out of all the Pok\emon Gym Badges,\n"
	"Rustboro's is the coolest, I'd say."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_YoureNewAroundHere {
	"Oh? Who might you be?\n"
	"You're a new face around these parts.\p"
	"Have you just transferred into the\n"
	"Pok\emon Trainer's School?"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_GymLeaderIsntEasyWithFire {
	"I challenged the Gym Leader, but\.\p"
	"It's not going to be easy winning with\n"
	"my Fire-type Pok\emon\.\p"
	"Fire-type Pok\emon don't match up\n"
	"well against Rock-type Pok\emon\."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_MrBrineyWalksInTheTunnel {
	"The old sailor Mr. Briney lives in\n"
	"a cottage by the sea.\p"
	"He goes for walks in the tunnel every\n"
	"so often."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_MrBrineyLovesPeeko {
	"The old sailor Mr. Briney lives in\n"
	"a cottage by the sea.\p"
	"He said he was going shopping in\n"
	"Slateport for his pet, Peeko.\p"
	"That old sea dog, he must really love\n"
	"that Peeko."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_WowYouHavePokemon {
	"Wow, you have Pok\emon with you, too.\p"
	"When I get bigger, I'm going to go\n"
	"places with Pok\emon, too."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_CatchRarePokemonIfIGoToSchool {
	"Pok\emon Trainer's School!\p"
	"If I go to this school, will I be able\n"
	"to catch rare Pok\emon easily?"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_PokemonCanChangeLookFromExp {
	"If a Pok\emon gains experience in\n"
	"battles, it can sometimes change in\l"
	"the way it looks."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_PokemonChangeShape {
	"A Pok\emon changes shape?\n"
	"If one did that, I would be shocked!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_TradePokemonGrowFast {
	"A Pok\emon you get in a trade from\n"
	"someone grows fast.\p"
	"But if you don't have certain Gym\n"
	"Badges, it may not obey you\."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_OutOfTheWay {
	"Get out!\n"
	"Out of the way!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_WaitDontTakeMyGoods {
	"Wait! Pleeeaaase!\p"
	"Don't take my Goods!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_HelpMeIWasRobbed {
	"Oh, it's you!\p"
	"You're that fantastic Trainer who\n"
	"helped me in Petalburg Woods!\p"
	"Help me! I was robbed by Team Aqua!\n"
	"I have to get the Devon Goods back!\p"
	"If I don't\.\n"
	"I'm going to be in serious trouble."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_ShadyCharacterTookOffTowardsTunnel {
	"That shady character, I think he took\n"
	"off towards the tunnel over there."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_YouGotItThankYou {
	"Oh! How did it go?\n"
	"The Devon Goods?\p"
	"You did!\n"
	"You got them back!\p"
	"You really are a great Trainer!\p"
	"I know! As my thanks, I'll give you\n"
	"another Great Ball!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_YoureLoadedWithItems {
	"You're loaded with items.\n"
	"I can't give you this Great Ball."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_PleaseComeWithMe {
	"Excuse me, please!\n"
	"Please come with me!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_MayHiLetsRegister {
	"May: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
	"You had a Match Call feature put\n"
	"on your Pok\eNav!\p"
	"Let's register each other so we can\n"
	"contact one another anytime!\p"
	"\. \. \. \. \. \."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_RegisteredMay {
	"Registered May\n"
	"in the Pok\eNav."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_MayPassedBrineyWantToBattle {
	"May: Oh, by the way, I passed\n"
	"Mr. Briney in Petalburg Woods.\p"
	"I guess he's on his way home to his\n"
	"cottage by the sea.\p"
	"How's your Pok\edex coming along,\n"
	"{PLAYER}{KUN}? Mine's looking pretty decent!\p"
	"So\.\n"
	"How about a little battle?"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_MayOhHaventRaisedPokemonEnough {
	"May: Oh, what's the matter?\p"
	"Haven't you caught or raised your\n"
	"Pok\emon very much?\p"
	"That's not very good for a Trainer!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_MayWantToBattle {
	"May: So, what do you think?\n"
	"How about a little battle here?"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_MayImNotGoingToLose {
	"May: You just became a Trainer,\n"
	"{PLAYER}{KUN}. I'm not going to lose!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_MayDefeat {
	"Yikes!\n"
	"You're better than I expected!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_MayMrBrineyHint {
	"May: Oh, by the way, Mr. Briney, who\n"
	"I just passed\.\p"
	"{PLAYER}{KUN}, you just moved here so you\n"
	"might not know this, but Mr. Briney\l"
	"was once a revered seafarer."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_BrendanHiLetsRegister {
	"Brendan: Oh, hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
	"You had a Match Call feature put\n"
	"on your Pok\eNav! Cool!\p"
	"Let's register each other so we can\n"
	"get in touch anytime!\p"
	"\. \. \. \. \. \."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_RegisteredBrendan {
	"Registered Brendan\n"
	"in the Pok\eNav."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_BrendanPassedBrineyWantToBattle {
	"Brendan: By the way, {PLAYER}, I walked\n"
	"by Mr. Briney in Petalburg Woods.\p"
	"I bet he was on his way home to his\n"
	"cottage by the sea.\p"
	"{PLAYER}, how's your Pok\edex?\n"
	"Have you filled in any pages yet?\p"
	"Mine rules.\p"
	"Want to have a battle to test how\n"
	"far you've progressed?"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_BrendanNoConfidenceInPokemon {
	"Brendan: What's the matter? Don't have\n"
	"any confidence in your Pok\emon?"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_BrendanWantToBattle {
	"Brendan: What's up?\n"
	"Want to have a battle with me?"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_BrendanIWontGoEasy {
	"Brendan: I know you just became\n"
	"a Trainer, but I won't go easy!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_BrendanDefeat {
	"Hmm\.\n"
	"You're pretty good."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_BrendanMrBrineyHint {
	"Brendan: By the way, you know\n"
	"Mr. Briney? The guy I just passed?\p"
	"I bet you didn't know this, since you\n"
	"just moved here, {PLAYER}, but\l"
	"Mr. Briney was once a great sailor."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_TunnelNearingCompletion {
	"\qoTimesaving tunnel nearing\n"
	"completion!\qc\p"
	"\.Is what it says on the sign, but\n"
	"there's also a big \qoX\qc splashed\l"
	"across it in red paint\."
}

text(local) ustboroCity_Text_DevonCorpSign {
	"Devon Corporation\p"
	"\qoFor all your living needs, we make\n"
	"it all.\qc"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_GymSign {
	"Rustboro City Pok\emon Gym\n"
	"Leader: Roxanne\p"
	"\qoThe Rock-loving honors student!\qc"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_DevonCorpBranchOfficeSign {
	"Devon Corp. Branch Office\p"
	"\qoAccess limited to Devon employees\n"
	"and authorized personnel.\qc"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_CitySign {
	"Rustboro City\p"
	"\qoThe city probing the integration of\n"
	"nature and science.\qc"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_TrainersSchoolSign {
	"Pok\emon Trainer's School\p"
	"\qoWe'll teach you anything about\n"
	"Pok\emon!\qc"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_CuttersHouse {
	"Cutter's House"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_DevelopedNewPokenavFeature {
	"I've been developing an added feature\n"
	"for the Pok\eNav\.\p"
	"And it turned out great!\p"
	"{PLAYER}, may I see that Pok\eNav?\n"
	"The one our President gave you?"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_AddedMatchCallPleaseCallMrStone {
	"There you go, {PLAYER}!\p"
	"I added a new feature named\n"
	"Match Call to your Pok\eNav.\p"
	"Using the Match Call feature,\n"
	"you can chat with people who have\l"
	"been registered in your Pok\eNav.\p"
	"{PLAYER}, our President Stone should\n"
	"be registered in your Pok\eNav.\p"
	"Test it out.\n"
	"Please give our President a call."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_PleaseSelectPokenav {
	"Please select the Pok\eNav."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_IdBetterGetBackToWork {
	"Okay, I'd better get back to work.\n"
	"Please take care, {PLAYER}!"
}

text(local) RustboroCity_Text_YouCanHave2On2Battle {
	"Did you know this?\p"
	"You can have a 2-on-2 battle even\n"
	"if you're not with another Trainer.\p"
	"If you catch the eyes of two Trainers\n"
	"when you have two or more Pok\emon,\l"
	"they'll both challenge you.\p"
	"Don't you think it'd be cool if you\n"
	"could beat two Trainers by yourself?"
}
